{"title":"Vulture Quill","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Old Bonebeak, Carrion Vulture, Giant Vulture, Boneyard Vulture</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"carrion-vulture\" title=\"Carrion Vulture - dropped it in 2 of 2 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d69ffeb8f207220f4dbc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Carrion Vulture</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1–5</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"giant-vulture\" title=\"Giant Vulture - dropped it in 2 of 3 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7eb9b75673d5a4ea01cb.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Giant Vulture</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–10</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"boneyard-vulture\" title=\"Old Bonebeak - dropped it in 5 of 9 looted corpses (1/1.8)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/848c5b3078e044665e81.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Old Bonebeak</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.8<br>×1–6</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"vulture-quill\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/90d5c9480dcb277fd232.svg\" alt=\"Vulture Quill\"></div><h3>Vulture Quill</h3><table>\n      \n 